# Word of Command (CR 723.2, 608.2g, 733.1-2): "the player plays that card if able" is a requirement, not an offer. Bot1,
# controlling Bot2, is not offered to give the forced Fireball up (`! Bot2.Cancel` at its X). Bot1 announces X as 3, which
# Bot2's two Mountains can't pay: the cast can't be completed, is reversed whole (CR 733.1), and is made again, as the effect
# still says (CR 733.2) - the X of 3 that failed is no longer one it may be made with. With X 1 it is cast, and Bot2 takes 1.

